WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.802
Harry: From calorie count to portion sizes,

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.237
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:06.606
between Pringles in the UK and the US.

00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:08.274
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.012
In the UK, our smallest Pringle size

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:13.413
is a 40-gram tube.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.316
These come as a single tube,

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.184
as a box of 12,

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.519
or, around the holidays,

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.888
we can get a Pringles Christmas cracker,

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.491
which comes with four 40-gram tubes.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.826
In the US, the smallest
portion of Pringles you can get

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.095
is this, a snack stack.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.932
This 19-gram snack stack comes in units of

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:34.868
12, 18,

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:37.237
this is super weird, 27,

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.505
and

00:00:38.505 --> 00:00:40.407
[grunts]

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:44.310
48 snack stacks.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:46.679
Our next size is a 70-gram tube.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:50.950
We also have Pringles in
this grab-and-go size,

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.320
which is 2.5 ounces, or 71 grams.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.955
You can get them in single, obviously,

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.524
or in packs of 15.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.360
This isn't even the biggest
grab-and-go size, apparently.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.728
They have a size that's even bigger,

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.998
that's 74 grams, or 2.5 ounces.

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.566
Uh, I ate that on the way here.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.033
I'm sorry.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.369
And then from there we
go to a full-sized tube,

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.571
which is 200 grams.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.506
All flavors weigh the
same amount in the UK.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.943
In the US, our regular
tubes are actually small.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.780
You get about 5.5 ounces per tube,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.383
but the flavor actually
adds to the weight.

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:25.385
Here's an original Pringles,

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:27.921
and this is only 5.2 ounces. Huh.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:28.888
0.3.

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.623
0.3 more for the flavor.

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:32.325
But the UK stops at the regular.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.326
Not here in the US.

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:34.494
Check it out.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.864
The party tube. [laughs]

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:42.202
6.8 ounces of chip right there.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:43.403
Seeing as the weights are so similar,

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:44.537
we're going to count how many Pringles

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.705
are in a UK regular tube

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:48.441
versus a US party-stack tube
to see who's getting more.

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:50.743
All right, let's do it.

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:53.780
Oh, yeah.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.318
Harry: Yeah, definitely
gonna need a bigger tray.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:01:59.853
I might have to go onto the table.

00:01:59.853 --> 00:02:01.488
This is going to be boring.

00:02:01.488 --> 00:02:03.056
Pringles, they don't break as easily.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:04.624
Oh!

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.126
I have regularly eaten

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.694
a whole tube of Pringles by myself.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:11.397
Ah!

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.065
Quack.

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:13.399
What, where? Here?

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:15.101
Conner: A little down.
Joe: This one?

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:16.402
I'm going to eat them all

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:17.804
instead of putting them back in the tube.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.072
Joe: It's taking all my willpower

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.141
not to snack on these as I'm doing it.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.379
Laura: Most people can't then
swallow the whole thing.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.148
Most people aren't me.

00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:29.883
[laughs]

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.817
I'm not most people, Laura.

00:02:31.017 --> 00:02:35.588
Party stack holds roughly 104 Pringles.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.990
So, it looks like a regular tube in the UK

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.858
contains around 92 Pringles.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.126
How many can I get in my mouth at once?

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:41.127
That's what I want to know.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:43.630
Without, like, crunching them
all up and breaking them.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:44.531
I'm gonna see if I can do 10.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.365
9.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:47.400
10 Pringles.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.602
I'm going for 13. Lucky 13!

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:52.672
Ah, ah, ah, ah!

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:55.341
Uh-uh.

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.411
I'm gonna take two off.

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.820
[production crew laughing]

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.227
I do not have the mouth
for Pringles, apparently.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:16.196
My proverbial hat off to you.

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:17.630
The crown is yours.

00:03:19.566 --> 00:03:21.334
This right here is roughly 100 grams

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.603
of original salted Pringles chips.

00:03:23.603 --> 00:03:25.338
In the US, it contains the following:

00:03:25.338 --> 00:03:26.973
535 calories,

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:29.108
32.13 grams of fat,

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:32.478
535.5 milligrams of sodium,

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:35.448
and 57.12 grams of carbs.

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:36.649
I know you can't tell,

00:03:36.649 --> 00:03:39.352
but this is, like, two-thirds
of the tube, right?

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.520
And it contains almost half

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.654
of your fat allowance for the day.

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.323
100 grams of original Pringles

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:45.225
in the UK contains the following:

00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:46.559
514 calories,

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:47.827
33 grams of fat,

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.462
520 milligrams of sodium,

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:50.730
and 51 grams of carbs.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:52.632
That means our Pringles
have slightly more fat

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:53.466
than the US version,

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:55.101
but almost half the saturated fat.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:57.637
In the US, a majority
of the Pringle flavors

00:03:57.637 --> 00:04:00.139
have the same number of
calories as the original flavor,

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:01.641
but there are some changes

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:03.977
to some of the other
numbers when you branch out.

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:05.912
Our saltiest Pringle is
actually the salt and vinegar.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.313
100 grams of UK salt and vinegar

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:09.415
is 40% of your daily allowance of sodium.

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:10.917
The saltiest Pringles in the US

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:11.918
are the Buffalo ranch.

00:04:11.918 --> 00:04:16.556
100 grams of them contain
999.6 milligrams of sodium.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:25.732
Avoid! Avoid!

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.901
What in the good God?!

00:04:28.901 --> 00:04:30.336
Oh, man!

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:34.607
I can't believe the
flavor in these things.

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:36.242
I gotta try that again.

00:04:39.779 --> 00:04:41.314
Oh, my God.

00:04:41.314 --> 00:04:42.882
These are so disgusting.

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:44.951
This might be the worst thing
I've tasted on this show.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:49.355
All the salt for all the
Buffalo ranch in the factory

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:51.824
got condensed into one
container on accident,

00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:52.659
and we bought it.

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:53.960
This is so gross.

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:59.899
In the UK, original Pringles
contain the following:

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.301
dehydrated potatoes,

00:05:01.301 --> 00:05:03.469
vegetable oils (sunflower and corn),

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:06.172
rice flour, wheat starch, corn flour,

00:05:06.172 --> 00:05:08.941
emulsifier (E471), maltodextrin,

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.476
salt, yeast extract,

00:05:10.476 --> 00:05:12.445
yeast powder, and color (annatto).

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.647
Original Pringles in the US contain

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:16.249
dried potatoes; vegetable oil,

00:05:16.249 --> 00:05:17.784
which is corn, cottonseed,

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:20.620
high oleic soybean oil
and/or sunflower oil;

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.623
degerminated yellow
corn flour; cornstarch;

00:05:23.623 --> 00:05:25.958
rice flour; maltodextrin;

00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:29.162
mono- and diglycerides;
salt; and wheat starch.

00:05:29.362 --> 00:05:31.064
These are actually very similar.

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:33.266
The E471 in the UK is actually the same

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:35.234
as the mono- and
diglycerides used in the US,

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.235
just used by a different name.

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:38.471
The only other notable changes

00:05:38.471 --> 00:05:40.073
are the yeast used in the UK

00:05:40.073 --> 00:05:42.342
and the fact that the
UK colors its Pringles

00:05:42.342 --> 00:05:44.644
with annatto, an orange-red food color.

00:05:44.644 --> 00:05:46.179
But how much different is the color?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.282
OK.

00:05:49.282 --> 00:05:51.184
The longest ingredient list
for a classic Pringles flavor

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:52.819
in the UK is prawn cocktail.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:54.420
It contains 28 main ingredients,

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.588
likely with a lot more

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:56.756
because some of them
aren't fully disclosed,

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.191
like the flavorings and the spices.

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:01.594
Now, from what I can tell,

00:06:01.594 --> 00:06:05.698
the longest ingredients
list for a classic US flavor

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.767
is the cheddar and sour cream.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:10.169
They contain 32 main ingredients.

00:06:10.169 --> 00:06:12.205
Along with a bunch of subingredients,

00:06:12.205 --> 00:06:13.740
takes the total to 40.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.841
I'm not reading this out loud.

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:16.109
On that list you'll see, of course,

00:06:16.109 --> 00:06:17.477
a couple of ingredients
that you won't find

00:06:17.477 --> 00:06:18.478
in the UK Pringles,

00:06:18.478 --> 00:06:22.515
namely Yellow No. 5 and Yellow No. 6.

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.183
I'm wearing Yellow No. 7.

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:25.651
It's always with the yellow stuff.

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:26.853
These are also referred to as

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.621
tartrazine and Sunset Yellow.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:29.756
They were two chemicals highlighted

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.557
by a study back in 2007

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:33.993
into links between hyperactivity
and food additives.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.228
The initial results suggested that

00:06:35.228 --> 00:06:36.129
there was indeed a link

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:37.997
between these chemicals and hyperactivity.

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:39.999
However, since then, the
European Food Safety Authority

00:06:39.999 --> 00:06:42.034
has backtracked and said
that might not be the case.

00:06:42.034 --> 00:06:45.738
Also in that study was
Red 40, aka Allura Red,

00:06:45.738 --> 00:06:46.973
which appears in the ingredients list

00:06:46.973 --> 00:06:48.374
for the Memphis barbecue Pringles

00:06:48.374 --> 00:06:50.209
and these, the pizza Pringles.

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:51.577
Foods using these chemicals in the UK

00:06:51.577 --> 00:06:53.112
must still bear a warning to say that

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.447
they "May have an adverse effect

00:06:54.447 --> 00:06:56.382
on activity and attention in children,"

00:06:56.382 --> 00:06:57.517
which means that most manufacturers

00:06:57.517 --> 00:06:58.551
will just avoid using them.

00:06:58.818 --> 00:07:00.987
Wait, has he always been bald?

00:07:00.987 --> 00:07:02.555
Yeah, he's bald. Thought he had hair.

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:03.890
Conner: I always thought he wore a top hat,

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:04.791
for whatever reason.

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:07.393
No, you're thinking of the
guy from the Monopoly thing.

00:07:07.393 --> 00:07:09.262
No, wait, look! Yeah! Hair.

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:10.096
What the hell?

00:07:10.096 --> 00:07:12.098
Hair and no hair.

00:07:12.098 --> 00:07:13.666
Julius Pringle!

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:14.801
What's going on, dude?

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:16.235
Is this weird? This is weird, right?

00:07:16.335 --> 00:07:17.904
Hairgate 2021.

00:07:17.904 --> 00:07:19.839
Why does he have hair in some
and not on the other ones?

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:23.409
Here are all the Pringles
you'll find in the UK,

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:24.477
but not the US.

00:07:24.477 --> 00:07:27.814
These are most of the
US-exclusive Pringles.

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:30.950
Cheddar and sour cream, jalapeño, pizza,

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:33.219
honey mustard, which sounds weird.

00:07:36.222 --> 00:07:37.523
Ugh.

00:07:37.523 --> 00:07:40.226
No, no, no.

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:43.162
Oh, those taste like a mistake.

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:44.363
Someone screwed up on those.

00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:45.331
That might be the worst one.

00:07:45.331 --> 00:07:46.432
The Buffalo one was just too salty,

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:47.834
but that is the worst flavor.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:51.304
I mean, this stuff is made

00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:52.805
for 13-year-old gamers.

00:07:52.805 --> 00:07:55.041
This is just made to sit and consume

00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:56.709
while you're staring at a flashing screen.

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.946
Stimulus, stimulus, stimulus.

00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:02.982
Like, I'm in awe of how intense these are.

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:05.852
[grunts]

00:08:06.052 --> 00:08:08.020
Hey, Joe, can I try one
of those ranch Pringles?

00:08:15.795 --> 00:08:16.896
It's quite, quite splintered.

00:08:16.896 --> 00:08:18.130
Didn't survive the journey.

00:08:18.564 --> 00:08:20.700
I like that. That's a good Pringle.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.001
Need to get these over here.

00:08:22.201 --> 00:08:24.036
Oh, God.

00:08:24.036 --> 00:08:25.438
Buff – was it Buffalo ranch?

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:26.405
Yeah, I'm not eating these.

00:08:26.405 --> 00:08:27.240
I'll skip those.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.575
Hey, it's the Screamin' Dill Pickle!

00:08:29.575 --> 00:08:30.409
Arr!

00:08:31.544 --> 00:08:33.312
What is going, what is
going on on this label?

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:37.850
Chip is wearing goggles and a snorkel?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.218
It would have been better
if the chip was just like

00:08:39.218 --> 00:08:39.785
[yells]

00:08:42.755 --> 00:08:45.992
You know when you go and
get a burger and the fries

00:08:45.992 --> 00:08:48.427
and they put that wedge
of pickle on the side

00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:50.830
and the pickle's touching
some of the fries

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.032
and then those fries taste like pickles?

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:55.568
This is a whole flavor of that.

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:57.370
Who wants that?

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.338
Over here we've got prawn cocktail.

00:08:59.338 --> 00:09:00.973
Now, this is really popular in the UK.

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:02.775
For those who aren't
familiar with prawn cocktail,

00:09:02.775 --> 00:09:04.043
there is no prawn in here.

00:09:04.043 --> 00:09:06.412
What this is, is the sauce
that you would normally serve

00:09:06.412 --> 00:09:07.380
with a prawn cocktail.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.315
It's just a kind of
tangy, tomatoey Pringle.

00:09:09.315 --> 00:09:10.716
And, personally, I'm a big fan.

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:11.784
Then we're moving on to this one,

00:09:11.784 --> 00:09:12.885
which is paprika flavor.

00:09:12.885 --> 00:09:15.621
In this menacing-looking black, fiery can,

00:09:15.621 --> 00:09:16.856
we have hot and spicy Pringles,

00:09:16.856 --> 00:09:17.957
but they're basically just Pringles

00:09:17.957 --> 00:09:19.425
flavored with some jalapeño extract

00:09:19.425 --> 00:09:21.327
along with some other peppers as well.

00:09:26.032 --> 00:09:27.900
They don't smell too spicy.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:28.734
Cheers.

00:09:32.305 --> 00:09:34.473
I'm getting, like, a little bit of garlic,

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:35.341
little bit of tomato.

00:09:35.341 --> 00:09:36.542
Not getting any heat though.

00:09:36.542 --> 00:09:39.178
People insist on calling
things hot and spicy

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:41.113
and then make things that really
aren't that hot and spicy.

00:09:41.113 --> 00:09:42.682
Next up we've got smokey bacon Pringles.

00:09:42.682 --> 00:09:44.951
Personally, I love these,
but I will say if you eat one

00:09:44.951 --> 00:09:46.552
they stay on your breath
for about two weeks,

00:09:46.552 --> 00:09:48.321
regardless of how many
times you brush your teeth.

00:09:48.321 --> 00:09:49.822
Then we've got some peri-peri Pringles.

00:09:49.822 --> 00:09:51.457
Now, if you've seen the Nando's episode,

00:09:51.457 --> 00:09:52.391
you'll know that, as a country,

00:09:52.391 --> 00:09:54.293
the UK is obsessed with peri-peri chicken,

00:09:54.293 --> 00:09:55.528
and Pringles have capitalized on that

00:09:55.528 --> 00:09:57.363
with some
peri-peri-chicken-flavored Pringles.

00:09:57.563 --> 00:09:58.831
According to the UK Pringles website,

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.433
you should also be able
to get steak Pringles

00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:01.901
and Thai sweet chili Pringles.

00:10:01.901 --> 00:10:03.402
But none of the
supermarkets that I visited

00:10:03.402 --> 00:10:04.236
actually had any.

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:05.938
Now, in both the US and the UK,

00:10:05.938 --> 00:10:07.607
you can get spicier Pringles.

00:10:07.607 --> 00:10:09.642
In the US, they are called Scorchin'.

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:11.444
How hot could these possibly be?

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:13.879
Scorchin' chili lime.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:15.948
Not that hot.

00:10:16.949 --> 00:10:17.783
Actually –

00:10:17.783 --> 00:10:18.618
yeah, no.

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:20.620
Instead of Scorchin',
our spicy Pringle range

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.622
is actually called Sizzl'n.

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:23.990
Sizzl'n. It's fun to say.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:26.592
And it comes in a Kickin'
Sour Cream exclusive

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:28.594
or as an extra-hot cheese
and chili exclusive,

00:10:28.594 --> 00:10:30.296
which unfortunately we
weren't able to find today.

00:10:30.429 --> 00:10:31.397
It's sizzle time.

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:32.632
Sizzl'n sour cream is a strange one,

00:10:32.632 --> 00:10:34.467
because sour cream is the
thing you're supposed to use

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:36.736
to, like, cool the heat down.

00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:42.274
Definitely attack your tongue a bit more

00:10:42.274 --> 00:10:43.376
than the hot and spicy ones did.

00:10:43.376 --> 00:10:44.910
Still not, like, mind-blowingly hot.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.780
Also in the US we got these wavy Pringles,

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.216
which look like they're just
straight ripping off Ruffles.

00:10:50.216 --> 00:10:51.584
Classic salted,

00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:53.219
applewood-smoked cheddar,

00:10:53.219 --> 00:10:54.654
fire-roasted jalapeño,

00:10:54.654 --> 00:10:56.288
sweet and spicy barbecue,

00:10:56.288 --> 00:10:58.324
and something to do with
the video game high-low –

00:10:58.324 --> 00:10:59.158
[sighs] "high-low."

00:10:59.158 --> 00:11:01.827
It's something to do
with the video game Halo,

00:11:01.827 --> 00:11:02.995
MOA Burger.

00:11:02.995 --> 00:11:04.430
All this is for children.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.965
This is all for children.

00:11:05.965 --> 00:11:07.133
We might not have wavy Pringles,

00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.001
but we do have rice fusion Pringles.

00:11:09.001 --> 00:11:10.636
These are Pringles
which are made with rice

00:11:10.636 --> 00:11:12.271
and inspired by Asian flavors.

00:11:12.371 --> 00:11:14.306
Indian tandoori chicken masala flavor

00:11:14.306 --> 00:11:15.908
and a Japanese katsu curry flavor.

00:11:16.142 --> 00:11:17.543
We're supposed to also be able to get

00:11:17.543 --> 00:11:19.045
Malaysian red curry flavor,

00:11:19.045 --> 00:11:20.980
a Peking duck and hoisin sauce flavor,

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.415
and a barbecue teriyaki flavor.

00:11:22.515 --> 00:11:24.583
The last exclusive Pringles
I want to talk about

00:11:24.583 --> 00:11:26.919
are the original lightly salted.

00:11:27.386 --> 00:11:29.655
Yeah. Perfect.

00:11:29.655 --> 00:11:31.691
This is how potato
chips should taste like.

00:11:32.925 --> 00:11:35.394
Yeah. Unfortunately,
Pringles lightly salted

00:11:35.394 --> 00:11:37.229
equals normal everywhere else.

00:11:37.229 --> 00:11:38.264
It's so bizarre.

00:11:38.264 --> 00:11:40.533
It's like hair and no hair.

00:11:40.533 --> 00:11:41.600
Why they made that choice?

